# Kubeflow Optimizer

## Role

`OptimizerClient` (`api/optimizer_client.py`) runs hyperparameter search by creating Katib
experiments from `TrainJobTemplate` trials. Kubernetes-only via `KubernetesBackendConfig`.

## Package map

| Path | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| `api/optimizer_client.py` | `optimize()`, job listing, results |
| `backends/kubernetes/backend.py` | Katib Experiment CR lifecycle |
| `backends/kubernetes/utils.py` | Experiment spec from trial template |
| `types/optimization_types.py` | `Objective`, `OptimizationJob`, `Result`, `TrialConfig` |
| `types/algorithm_types.py` | Search algorithms (`BaseAlgorithm` subclasses) |
| `types/search_types.py` | Search space parameter types |

## Invariants

- `optimize(trial_template, *, search_space, trial_config, objectives, algorithm)` builds Katib Experiment CRs.
- Unit tests mock K8s API; `backend_test.py` is large — add focused cases, don't duplicate.
- Uses `kubeflow-katib-api` (see `pyproject.toml`).

## Verify

```bash
make lint-imports
uv run pytest -q kubeflow/optimizer/backends/kubernetes/backend_test.py
uv run ruff check kubeflow/optimizer/path/to/file.py
```

## CRD schemas

Katib Experiment CRD: [.agents/api/surfaces.yaml](../../.agents/api/surfaces.yaml) (`Experiment` under `crds`).
